{"id":"n3-047","title":"～てくれと","romaji":"〜te kureto","jlptLevel":3,"shortExplanation":"Quote someone's request (telling someone to do something).","longExplanation":"The ～てくれと grammar point is used when quoting a request or command made by someone else. It literally means 'someone said “please do …”'. Typically used as 「～てくれと頼む/言う」 to indicate being asked or told to do something.","formation":"Verb-て form + くれと (言う / 頼む / 伝える, etc.)","examples":[{"jp":"電話をかけてくれと言われました。","romaji":"Denwa o kakete kureto iwaremashita.","en":"I was told to make a phone call.","words":[{"surface":"電話","vocabId":"1443840","reading":"でんわ"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"かけ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"かける"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"くれ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"くれる"},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"言わ","vocabId":"1587040","reading":"いわ","baseForm":"言う"},{"surface":"れ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"れる"},{"surface":"まし","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ます"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[4,5]},{"jp":"この荷物を運んでくれと頼まれました。","romaji":"Kono nimotsu o hakonde kureto tanomaremashita.","en":"I was asked to carry this luggage.","words":[{"surface":"この","vocabId":null},{"surface":"荷物","vocabId":"1195430","reading":"にもつ"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"運んでくれ","vocabId":"1172660","reading":"はこんでくれ","baseForm":"運ぶ"},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"頼ま","vocabId":"1548370","reading":"たのま","baseForm":"頼む"},{"surface":"れ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"れる"},{"surface":"まし","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ます"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[3,4]},{"jp":"最後まで待ってくれとお願いされました。","romaji":"Saigo made matte kureto onegai saremashita.","en":"I was asked to wait until the end.","words":[{"surface":"最後まで","vocabId":"1293830","reading":"さいごまで"},{"surface":"待ってくれ","vocabId":"1410590","reading":"まってくれ","baseForm":"待つ"},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"お願い","voca